+| 0166 | 2026-10-18 | AI assistant, a small tool (your request, "next smaller bit"): **the date and time tool**, `current_time`, from the plan's tool list (3.2 tool 9). It gives the model today's date, the weekday, the time and time zone on the till, and the dates this week, this month and last month started and ended, so *yesterday*, *this week* and *last month* are real dates it can hand to `sales_report` and `find_orders` instead of a guess. It reads only the till clock: no shop data, no store, nothing that can write, and it works whether or not a snapshot was taken. The system prompt names it and says never to guess the date. Files: `src/lib/assistantTime.ts`, with `ToolContext.now` and a `now` option on `makeToolSet`. The tool count is now thirteen. Tests: `tests/assistanttime.test.ts`. Device test T64. |
