 two tools, not one, because *what is low* and *what does this cost* are different questions for a small model; stock is as of the last sync, never live from Shopify (question 12); when only some variations of a product match, no total is given for the product; cost is in the detail form only, for every role (as decided for Reports in 0163); draft and archived products are left out unless asked for. Not tried on a real iPad. Not in this patch: cash drawer, calculators and current cart (patch 8), the practice mode coach (patch 9), settings reader and app and sync status (patch 10) | your request |
